TE` won't set `_is_queued_for_deletion` to false, because the object would still remain in the queue.\r\n\r\nSee my code example and the output at the bottom. The first call to `is_queued_for_deletion()` in `_ready()` should return true, because calling `cancel_free()` immediately after `queue_delete()`/`queue_free()` shouldn't have any effect.","created_at":"2025-09-14T06:40:51Z","updated_at":"2025-09-14T09:22:17Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110079#discussion_r2347150640","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/110079","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2347150640"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110079#discussion_r2347150640"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/110079"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2347150640/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":265,"original_start_line":265,"start_side":"RIGHT","line":267,"original_line":267,"side":"RIGHT","in_reply_to_id":2346865422,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","original_position":6,"position":1,"subject_type":"line"}]